msgstr "No se pudo encontrar la tarea en WP-Cron. Prueba desactivando este plugin y volviendo a activarlo."

#: admin/includes/tab-settings.php:1315
msgid "<dfn title=\"This option enables to schedule the WP-Cron event to remove the expired entries from &#8220;IP address cache&#8221; and &#8220;Validation logs&#8221;.\">Interval [sec] to cleanup expired entries of IP address</dfn>"
